A recursive component instantiated with a constant unrolls at build time, and
what is left is markup: four spans, and a page whose only script is an empty
`state`. Nothing about the component survives to run time, because nothing
instantiates it at run time.

It is the one declaration that stays on pkg.Components with no RuntimeInstance
mark -- it is its own caller, so the inliner meets an instantiation of it from
inside its own body and leaves the declaration standing even when every call
site of it unrolled. passComponentProps did not ask about the mark and promoted
its props to reactive cells anyway. That was not merely wasted work: the cells
made passReactivity treat the component's own `if` as a render slot, so the
page carried `__renderSlot0` at module scope reading `__prop_n`,
`__prop___depth`, `__inst1_live` and `__root` -- nine identifiers only a factory
declares -- and calling `__cf_countdown`, a factory no backend had reason to
emit. The first thing the page did on load was throw a ReferenceError, which
killed every handler on it.

The whole claim is what is *not* here, which is why this golden is four spans
long and carries three denies.

deny out/none/html/index.html `__prop_` -- a prop cell belongs to a factory's scope; the page has no instance to read one from
deny out/none/html/index.html `__renderSlot` -- an unrolled recursion has no reactive slot: its `if` was decided at build time
deny out/none/html/index.html `__cf_countdown` -- no factory is emitted for a declaration nothing instantiates at run time

-- app.sngl --
import . "sngl:ui"
import app "sngl:app"

output {
    none {
        html
    }
}

component countdown(n int) node {
    text(value="[" + string(n) + "]")
    if n > 0 {
        countdown(n=n - 1)
    }
}

component main node {
    countdown(n=3)
}

app.window {
    main
}
-- out/none/html/index.html --
<!-- Code generated by sngl (html) from app.sngl; DO NOT EDIT. -->

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
  </style>
</head><body>

<span>[3]</span>
<span>[2]</span>
<span>[1]</span>
<span>[0]</span>

<script>
(() => {
  // sngl-entry.js
  var state = {};
})();
</script>
</body></html>
